 beeta-desktop - Beeta Desktop Environment
Changes:
 beeta-desktop (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Initial release of Beeta Desktop Environment
   * GTK4 + Wayland layer-shell panels (top bar + bottom bar)
   * Beeta Adaptive Nature™ context-aware theming engine
   * Beeta Adaptive Motion™ performance-aware animation engine
   * Live Center dynamic status hub with MPRIS media integration
   * Desktop / Focus state management with auto-hiding bottom bar
   * Quick Settings popover with system controls
   * Fullscreen app launcher with search and categories
   * Wayfire compositor configuration with Liquid Glass™ blur
   * Systemd service for graphical.target
